## Development

Before creating a page:

- Explain component hierarchy
- List files to be created
- Reuse existing components whenever possible

## Frontend Environment Files

Frontend configuration must use:

- .env
- .env.production

Examples include:

- API Base URL
- Application Name
- Feature Flags
- Build Configuration

When introducing a new environment variable:

- Add it to both .env and .env.production.
- Use the same variable names across environments.
- Never hardcode API URLs inside components.
